Gallery shortlist
-----------------

packages/knowledge/galleries/curated.json is an offline pack. Gallery names
are facts about public awards, not a copy of gallery copy. The pack does
not fetch Godly or Awwwards, and it does not assume a Godly API. Site of
the Day is not labeled Site of the Year. A live refresh runs only when a
caller passes a fetcher and a non-empty allow list.

Imagine price card (2026-09-29)
-------------------------------

packages/assets/src/prices.ts holds Imagine output prices from the official
xAI card dated 2026-09-29:
https://docs.x.ai/developers/pricing

The table is a snapshot, not a live feed. The package does not read prices
from the network. Estimates must be recomputed if the card changes.
SuperGrok is not a billing source for these API jobs. DIY mode sends no
request. API mode uses the caller's own key and stops when the estimate
is above the remaining dollar cap.

